    mc "其实还是发短信给她比较好。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:696
translate chinese f1ebs_de7c8183:

    # hon "Oh, and one more thing before you go…"
    hon "哦对了还有件事——"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:705
translate chinese f1ebs_498b04a0:

    # "Slowly, seductively, [hon] turned around so that she was facing away from me. Gracefully, she bent forward and presented her round, firm ass cheeks prominently. Her tail flickered upward to give a clear view."
    "[hon]缓缓地转过身背对我，优雅地向前俯身，圆润紧实的臀部曲线完全展露。她的尾巴向上轻翘，让一切清晰可见。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:706
translate chinese f1ebs_657f2296:

    # "God damn, what is with these two sisers having amazing asses? And they're both capable of weaponizing them to tease me too!"
    "天呐，为什么这对姐妹都拥有这么迷人的屁股？还都擅长用这个优势来捉弄我！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:707
translate chinese f1ebs_0893c812:

    # hon "Is this what you want?"
    hon "这是你想要的吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:713
translate chinese f1ebs_50228771:

    # hon "Nggh, that's right! I'm just a dumb, slutty horse in heat~"
    hon "嗯…没错！我就是只发情期控制不住自己的笨马儿~"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:715
translate chinese f1ebs_c267f897:

    # hon "Right person, right place, right time, stud!"
    hon "对的人，对的地点，对的时间，还有位猛男！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:717
translate chinese f1ebs_21334399:

    # "She purred playfully over her shoulder, her back arching slightly to accentuate her ass even more enticingly. Every moment she made was deliberately designed to tease and tantalize me further."
    "她扭头发出猫儿般的咕噜声，后背微微弓起让臀部曲线更诱人。每个动作都像精心设计般撩拨着我的心弦。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:718
translate chinese f1ebs_d351e65f:

    # hon "Like what you see? Work here and I can give this and more."
    hon "喜欢看到的这些吗？来这儿工作，我能给你比这更多的惊喜。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:719
translate chinese f1ebs_24ab436a:

    # mc "Sheesh, you don’t make it a hard choice, do you?"
    mc "欸嘿，你这简直让人没法拒绝，对吧？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:720
translate chinese f1ebs_ed49af49:

    # hon "Bwahaha, see you soon, sugarcube. You can show yourself out since you let yourself in~"
    hon "噗哈哈，回头见啦，甜心。既然你能自己溜进来~那就自己溜出去吧~"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:726
translate chinese f1ebs_043847d3:

    # "[hon] walks away, her ass continuing swaying seductively until she’s completely out of view."
    "[hon]转身离去，臀部依然诱人地轻轻摆动，直到身影完全消失在视野中。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:728
translate chinese f1ebs_75e98fdc:

    # "Before I leave, I pay a quick visit to [blo]’s room upstairs."
    "离开前，我特意去楼上拜访[blo]的房间。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:732
translate chinese f1ebs_cb00c220:

    # "I knock on the door, hearing a ‘wah!’ and some frantic stumbling around. Eventually, [blo] opens the door."
    "我敲了敲门，听见里面传来“哇！”的惊呼和一阵手忙脚乱的动静。最后[blo]打开了门。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:733
translate chinese f1ebs_ef5f9f50:

    # blo "S-Sorry! You nearly gave me a heart attack – Wah! It’s you!"
    blo "对-对不起！你差点把我吓坏了——哇！原来是你呀！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:734
translate chinese f1ebs_b0b805e8:

    # mc "Haha, sorry about that. May I come in?"
    mc "哈哈，吓到你了真抱歉。方便让我进去吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:736
translate chinese f1ebs_03212284:

    # blo "Of course!"
    blo "当然！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:738
translate chinese f1ebs_2154419e:

    # "Closing the door behind me, I sit on [blo]’s half-made bed. It’s clear she made it but was recently ‘using’ it."
    "随手关上门，我坐在[blo]没整理好的床边。看得出她原本铺过床，但显然刚才还在“使用”它。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:739
translate chinese f1ebs_2769fcf5:

    # mc "Oh dear, looks like I caught you with your pants down."
    mc "哦，亲爱的，看来我正好撞见你脱裤子呢。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:741
translate chinese f1ebs_eee138db:

    # blo "Pardon?"
    blo "抱歉，你能再说一遍吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:742
translate chinese f1ebs_2a4c4510:

    # mc "Ah, that saying doesn’t work here at all, does it? Nevermind. I’m here to ask for your help."
    mc "啊，这个说法在这里完全不适用呢。算了，其实我是来请你帮忙的。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:743
translate chinese f1ebs_eaf9e1a2:

    # "I explain to [blo] that I’d like to send Anna a letter to invite her for a business meeting here at the Arcadian farm."
    "我向 [blo] 解释说我想给Anna写一封信以邀请她参加在Arcadia农场举行的商业会议。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:744
translate chinese f1ebs_b5d3a9b4:

    # "I’m sure if I can just get [hon] and Anna face-to-face, they’ll hit it off and plenty of opportunities will open up for [hon]."
    "我相信只要让[hon]和Anna见面，她们一定能相处融洽，这样[hon]也会获得更多发展机会。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:746
translate chinese f1ebs_63e821d5:

    # blo "If you think this’ll genuinely help, I’ll do it."
    blo "如果你觉得这真的能帮上忙，我愿意去做。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:747
translate chinese f1ebs_b06f80de:

    # mc "Thank you so much. Worst case scenario, Anna and [hon] don’t reach an agreement, nothing gained nothing lost."
    mc "非常感谢。最坏的情况也就是Anna和[hon]没达成一致，反正也不亏什么。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:749
translate chinese f1ebs_f33dbbe8:

    # blo "Thank you for trying to help us, that really means a lot."
    blo "谢谢你愿意帮助我们，这份心意对我们意义重大。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:750
translate chinese f1ebs_8f1b5069:

    # mc "It’s the least I can do after you’ve both been such good hosts."
    mc "你们俩都是成为了出色的东道主后，这只是我力所能及的一点心意。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:752
translate chinese f1ebs_c85899f8:

    # "[blo] blushes and acts innocent."
    "[blo]脸红着摆出无辜的表情。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:754
translate chinese f1ebs_5936a71a:

    # blo "If you, uh, if you- uhm… If you, ah…"
    blo "如果你，呃…如果你-嗯…要是你，呃…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:756
translate chinese f1ebs_fbdbc5b5:

    # blo "Come back and see me again! Okay?"
    blo "一定要再来看看我哦！好吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:757
translate chinese f1ebs_e4e710cb:

    # mc "I’m planning on it. Show me what you've got next time."
    mc "我已经在期待了。下次让我看看你的新花样。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:759
translate chinese f1ebs_630f95ba:

    # blo "Yes, sir!"
    blo "一言为定！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:762
translate chinese f1ebs_ce617998:

    # "…"
    "..."

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:766
translate chinese f1ebs_3774127e:

    # "Back in [mox]’s apartment, I finally sit down and take a rest."
    "回到 [mox] 的公寓，我终于得以休息。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:768
translate chinese f1ebs_706be5f7:

    # mox "Good evening, [mc]! Where’d you find yourself today?"
    mox "晚上好，[mc] ！今天你去哪了？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:769
translate chinese f1ebs_8b8ba15b:

    # mc "All the way to the farms in the northwest, and let me tell you, those two sisters could probably power a small village with their sexual repression alone."
    mc "一路到西北边的农场，有一说一那俩姐妹简直了，我感觉光靠她俩被压抑的性欲就能给一个小村庄供能。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:771
translate chinese f1ebs_7e497bd6:

    # mox "Mating season really can be like that sometimes. Especially when you think you’re handling it fine, but then an absolute hottie just appears out of nowhere."
    mox "大概发情期就是如此。尤其是她们本来在按部就班的忙活然后突然来了个猛男这样。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:772
translate chinese f1ebs_2278f95d:

    # mc "And I also know that I’m both of their types. So, it does feel like I’m cheating with my prior knowledge sometimes."
    mc "我也知道我是她俩的菜，所以有时我确实感觉自己利用原来宇宙的经验打了个信息差。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:774
translate chinese f1ebs_7b0b7df3:

    # mox "You’re on new game plus! Do you also know the winning lottery numbers?"
    mox "对啊这对你来说是二周目！那你知道中奖的彩票号码吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:775
translate chinese f1ebs_fa065b1b:

    # mc "I’m afraid it doesn’t quite work like that."
    mc "恐怕情况并非如此。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:777
translate chinese f1ebs_b26fbea4:

    # mox "Darn… I guess you didn't appear here at the exact same time and day in both universes, right?"
    mox "该死……我想你并没有在两个宇宙的同一时间同一天出现在此地，对吧？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:778
translate chinese f1ebs_0447c2fe:

    # mc "You're right, I didn't. But you do bring up an interesting point. My universe and this universe have a substantial number of events in common, but sometimes they happen at distinct times."
    mc "确实，我没有。但这个想法很有趣。两个宇宙很多事件是相同的，但是时间线不一样。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:780
translate chinese f1ebs_1b600f17:

    # mox "Any examples?"
    mox "比如？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:781
translate chinese f1ebs_16b084ef:

    # mc "Yeah, the most obvious one is that I teleported in at the wrong time. If that’s a fixed event in all these ‘types’ of universes, why happen months apart?"
    mc "嗯，就比如我穿越过来这件事。如果每个宇宙都在传送我那为什么时间相隔好几个月？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:782
translate chinese f1ebs_aa0c8fd2:

    # mc "With this in mind, if there’s anything that hasn’t happened yet, I might be able to predict it happening sometime in the future."
    mc "所以说，如果有什么我那边发生了但是这边没发生的事情，我会倾向于觉得是因为时候未到。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:784
translate chinese f1ebs_b2ac50dd:

    # mox "Hummm… I’m going to keep my eyes and ears wide open then!"
    mox "嗯...那时我会睁大眼睛和耳朵的！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:785
translate chinese f1ebs_93800be7:

    # mc "You’re going to keep your ears wide open?"
    mc "睁大耳朵？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:787
translate chinese f1ebs_96f72764:

    # mox "I’m not so good with words, okay?"
    mox "我不太善言辞，好吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:802
translate chinese farm2_cc8bc524:

    # "My phone buzzes in my bag, a message from [blo]. Anna’s coming today, and she asks to meet me at the barn if I’m free. I let her know I’ll be there in about half an hour."
    "我的手机在包里震动，我拿出来发现是[blo]的短信：Anna今天要来，她说如果我有空就在谷仓见我，我告诉她我半小时后到。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:804
translate chinese farm2_cfab67a7:

    # "As I make the trip north, the last of the day’s light filters through the clouds. The scent of hay and earth hangs in the air, a quiet calm settling over the farm."
    "我在黄昏时分向北出发前往农场。空气中弥漫着干草和泥土的气味，农场里一片祥和。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:806
translate chinese farm2_bddeebe2:

    # "I approach the barn and slip in. I can hear [blo], but I can't see her."
    "我靠近谷仓然后溜了进去，我能闻[blo]其声可不见其马。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:809
translate chinese farm2_cc76c920:

    # "Déjà vu. I look up like last time, only to lose my footing and fall down."
    "似曾相识的经历，我像上次一样抬头找她——然后一脚踩空。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:814
translate chinese farm2_af83e43e:

    # "I open my eyes to see a familiar sight from a different angle."
    "我睁开眼，又看到熟悉的景象，不过是另外的角度。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:815
translate chinese farm2_20cdc772:

    # blo "Are you alright?"
    blo "你还好吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:816
translate chinese farm2_6c47186f:

    # mc "I am now."
    mc "没事。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:817
translate chinese farm2_260f7476:

    # blo "We really have to stop meeting like this!"
    blo "我们能不能别每次这样见面了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:818
translate chinese farm2_668623cc:

    # mc "I don't mind it."
    mc "我倒无所谓。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:819
translate chinese farm2_4a0e561a:

    # blo "Are you going to stand up?"
    blo "你能站起来吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:820
translate chinese farm2_2025a6b2:

    # mc "Only if I have to."
    mc "需要的话。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:821
translate chinese farm2_136c455c:

    # blo "Bwahaha, you're making me really embarrassed, you know!"
    blo "哈哈...你明明知道我会尬死的！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:826
translate chinese farm2_96da3f4c:

    # "I nod and stumble back to my feet."
    "我表示同意，然后跌跌撞撞的站起来。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:828
translate chinese farm2_2a05e694:

    # blo "Thanks for coming."
    blo "感谢你能来。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:829
translate chinese farm2_22d6aa0d:

    # mc "A summon from you? I couldn’t miss that."
    mc "没关系，我随叫随到，"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:831
translate chinese farm2_f6261fa3:

    # blo "Thank you. Uuu, I’m so nervous! If this deal with Anna works out, I might finally have some time… for me. To do things I’ve always wanted to do, ya know?"
    blo "谢谢你！我真的很紧张！只要和Anna谈成了我就可以闲下来了！然后就可以做自己要做的，你懂吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:832
translate chinese farm2_3c22b82b:

    # "Her words tumble out in a rush. Even though she’s the type to put others first, to shoulder burdens without complaint, she’s still a shy, delicate kind. I can see how the weight of it all wears on her."
    "她的话语急促地倾泻而出。尽管她是那种优先考虑他人、默默承担重任的类型，但骨子里仍是一个害羞、娇弱的人。我能看出这些重压正消耗着她。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:833
translate chinese farm2_9d3579a2:

    # mc "If you do get some time to yourself, what are you going to do first?"
    mc "你真有空之后你想干什么？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:835
translate chinese farm2_a65eab83:

    # blo "Ahaha… I don’t know!"
    blo "哈...其实我没想过！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:836
translate chinese farm2_4d24f04a:

    # mc "Oh? No ideas at all?"
    mc "？完全没计划？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:838
translate chinese farm2_4423a5cf:

    # blo "That’s not it! I have too many ideas… I love music, art, maybe something I haven’t even discovered yet. I just… I’ve been stuck here, doing what needs to be done to survive, and I haven’t had the chance to really think about what I want."
    blo "其实有很多啦...我喜欢音乐画画还有其他的一些什么...但我一直忙于农场的事情，我从来没想过那些我真正想要的。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:839
translate chinese farm2_e916a396:

    # "Her voice goes quieter as she speaks, as if dwelling on the subject might sabotage the opportunity. There’s a yearning I recognize, a desire to not just change her circumstances, but herself too."
    "她越说声量越小，仿佛沉迷这个话题就会毁掉机会。我认出那种渴望——不仅是想改变处境，更想重塑自我。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:840
translate chinese farm2_5b245052:

    # mc "Sounds like you’ve got a lot of dreams stored in there. Maybe it’s about time you started chasing them."
    mc "听起来你心里藏着不少梦想。或许是时候开始追逐了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:842
translate chinese farm2_a61172a2:

    # blo "But… I don’t even know where to start. I’m not… I’m not like you. I can’t just…"
    blo "可是…我连从哪开始都不知道。我不像你…我没办法像你那样干脆…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:843
translate chinese farm2_0280713f:

    # mc "Hey. You’re selling yourself short. You’ve got more in you than you think. Sometimes you just need to take the first step, even if it’s a small one."
    mc "嘿，你太小看自己了。你拥有的潜力超乎想象。有时候迈出第一步就好，哪怕只是一小步。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:845
translate chinese farm2_a2216bf4:

    # "[blo] bites her lip, thinking. I can see the gears turning in her head, the conflict between her fear of failure and the desire for something more."
    "[blo]咬着嘴唇思考。我能看见她脑中的齿轮在转动，恐惧失败与渴望突破正在交锋。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:846
translate chinese farm2_6d82e492:

    # mc "You’ve got to stop worrying so much about what might go wrong. And maybe, start thinking about what could go right."
    mc "你得少操心可能出错的环节。或许，该多想想成功的美好景象。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:848
translate chinese farm2_4043fe71:

    # "She blushes, but there’s the start of a smile in the corners of her mouth."
    "她脸红了，但嘴角已扬起笑意的雏形。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:849
translate chinese farm2_b2937357:

    # blo "You make it sound so easy…"
    blo "你说得好像很简单似的…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:850
translate chinese farm2_dd009184:

    # mc "It’s not easy. But that’s what makes it worth it."
    mc "确实不容易。但正因如此才值得尝试。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:851
translate chinese farm2_5e9cee62:

    # mc "And hey, you don’t have to figure it all out at once. Just start with something small. Like telling me what you’re really passionate about."
    mc "再说了，不必一次性解决所有问题。从小事开始就好。比如先告诉我你真正热衷什么。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:853
translate chinese farm2_6d9ab82a:

    # "There’s a moment of silence between us. Finally, [blo] looks up at me, her face shining with a new kind of determination."
    "我们之间陷入片刻沉默。最终[blo]抬起头看向我，脸上焕发着崭新的决心。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:854
translate chinese farm2_f0dfb12c:

    # blo "I want to be brave! I want to stop being so scared of everything. Of failing, of what people think… I want to be able to talk to people, to make friends, to… to be more than just [blo], the shy girl who’s always in the background."
    blo "我想勇敢起来！不想再害怕一切。害怕失败，害怕他人眼光…我想学会与人交谈，结交朋友，成为…不仅仅是总躲在角落的害羞女孩[blo]。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:855
translate chinese farm2_bce5fcbc:

    # mc "Hm… Best way is to start being a little braver today. Do that every day, and you’re already halfway there."
    mc "嗯…最好的办法就是从今天开始勇敢一点点。每天坚持，就成功一半了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:857
translate chinese farm2_660ea3d7:

    # blo "{i}Giggle{/i} You make it sound like I can do anything."
    blo "{i} 呵呵 {/i}你说得好像我无所不能似的。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:858
translate chinese farm2_9fa80e04:

    # mc "Maybe you can. But if you ever need a little push, well, I’m here to help."
    mc "或许你真的可以。但如果需要助力，我随时都在。"

