# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1118
translate chinese farm2_825352b7:

    # "I could see the strain on [hon]’s face, the conflict between granting [blo] some freedom and the practical realities of keeping the farm running. Anna leaned back, contemplating the dilemma before taking a deep breath."
    "我能看出[hon]脸上的挣扎，既想给[blo]些自由，又得顾及维持农场运转的现实压力。Anna向后靠去，深思熟虑后深吸了一口气。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1119
translate chinese farm2_080e251a:

    # ann "I see… As you can understand there’s no catches here, no tricks or attempt to profit from you."
    ann "我明白了…如你所见，这里没有陷阱，没有花招，更没想从你身上捞好处。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1120
translate chinese farm2_2b2c6385:

    # ann "This isn’t even a business investment. I’m not asking for any profit from it long term. Once the machinery is paid off, the only thing I want is a good business relationship and hopefully, a friend."
    ann "这甚至不算商业投资。长期来说我不打算从中赚一分钱。等机械款项结清后，我唯一想要的就是保持良好的生意往来，最好还能多个朋友。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1122
translate chinese farm2_7044ddd4:

    # ann "But if you’d be willing… I can extend my offer in another way, a way that would profit me. If you’d be willing to act as a local distributor for my cows’ milk, I can adjust the deal."
    ann "不过如果你愿意…我可以用另一种方式扩展合作，能让我也获利的方式。只要你愿意当我牛奶的本地分销商，协议条款可以调整。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1123
translate chinese farm2_b21ceafe:

    # ann "This way, I hope the financial strain will ease enough to allow your sister to work less."
    ann "这样我希望经济压力能缓解到让你妹妹少干点活。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1125
translate chinese farm2_a0406b64:

    # "As if prepared, Anna presents one final piece of paper which causes [hon] to laugh."
    "像是早有准备似的，Anna抽出最后一张纸，把[hon]给逗笑了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1126
translate chinese farm2_98ec1f97:

    # hon "There’s such a thing as being too prepared, ya know?"
    hon "有一种事情是准备得太充分了，你知道吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1128
translate chinese farm2_2779972e:

    # "Despite that, she muses over the paper and nods."
    "尽管如此，她还是仔细看了看文件，然后点头同意。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1130
translate chinese farm2_446d189e:

    # hon "It’s a tight margin, but it’s doable. If this can give [blo] the freedom she deserves, it’s worth it."
    hon "利润虽然薄了点，但还能做。要是这样能让[blo]得到她该有的自由，就值了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1131
translate chinese farm2_14607b49:

    # "[hon]’s shoulders relax for the first time this entire conversation."
    "整个谈话中，[hon]的肩膀第一次放松下来。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1133
translate chinese farm2_d281a6d6:

    # ann "Thank you, [hon]! I appreciate your willingness to work with me on this. Let’s finalize the details and make sure everything is set up for a smooth transition."
    ann "谢谢你，[hon]！很高兴你愿意和我合作。我们来敲定细节，确保一切顺利过渡。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1136
translate chinese farm2_08e63935:

    # "As the two women began discussing the finer points of the agreement, the atmosphere in the room shifted. Conflict had softened into the cooperative hum of negotiation."
    "当两位女士开始讨论协议细节时，屋里的气氛悄然转变。先前的冲突软化成了合作协商的嗡嗡低语。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1141
translate chinese farm2_097ba490:

    # "As Anna prepared to leave, she paused by the door, casting a final glance at [hon]."
    "Anna准备离开时在门口停下脚步，回头朝[hon]投去最后一眼。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1142
translate chinese farm2_d0f965b7:

    # ann "With all that settled, I'll be back another night with the equipment."
    ann "既然都谈妥了，我改天晚上把设备带来。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1143
translate chinese farm2_03a97e70:

    # ann "Thank you for the delicious cider, and most of all, thank you for your patience in working through this with me."
    ann "谢谢你的苹果酒真好喝，更重要的是，谢谢你耐心陪我解决这个问题。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1144
translate chinese farm2_f3b76f31:

    # ann "It’s more than just a business deal — It’s a testament to how we can support each other, even when the road gets rough."
    ann "这不止是一笔生意——更证明了哪怕道路艰难，我们依然能相互扶持。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1146
translate chinese farm2_f2a88fac:

    # hon "I appreciate y’all understanding, Anna. This means more than you can know. It’s finally a chance for us to breath easier. I hope we can all look toward a brighter future."
    hon "Anna，谢谢你的理解。这意义远比你想象的重大。我们终于能喘口气了。希望咱们都能盼来更光明的未来。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1148
translate chinese farm2_15dd6c4f:

    # ann "And next time, introduce me to your boy toy, hmm~?"
    ann "下次记得把你那个“小玩具”介绍给我认识哦~？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1149
translate chinese farm2_1d57c612:

    # mc "Huh, me?!"
    mc "嗯，我吗？！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1151
translate chinese farm2_eb268d66:

    # hon "Ahaha, if you're lucky."
    hon "这个嘛，看你运气咯。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1157
translate chinese farm2_80c301d7:

    # "With that, Anna stepped out into the evening, leaving [hon] and I alone in the kitchen."
    "说完这句，Anna便踏进了夜色，留下[hon]和我在厨房里面面相觑。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1159
translate chinese farm2_4bed6f89:

    # hon "Phew! I can’t believe it. I never thought we’d reach an agreement like this. It’s going to make such a big difference for [blo] and me."
    hon "呼！真不敢相信。没想到能达成这样的协议。[blo]和我的日子肯定会轻松多了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1161
translate chinese farm2_f26eaf84:

    # hon "Although… You’ve been quiet throughout all this, considering you were the one that instigated it, hmm?"
    hon "不过…你这始作俑者倒是一直没吭声呢？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1162
translate chinese farm2_3f336529:

    # "Crap, she figured me out!"
    "糟了，被她发现了！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1163
translate chinese farm2_587403d7:

    # mc "I didn’t want to overshadow your moment. This deal is about you and the farm, all I can do is bring you together for the chance, the rest is on you."
    mc "我不想抢你风头。这笔交易关键在你和农场，我只不过牵线搭桥给个机会，剩下的全靠你自己。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1164
translate chinese farm2_6bb24ce3:

    # mc "And I can tell you’ve worked hard to get here, so this should be your achievement. I’m just glad to have been a small part of it."
    mc "而且我看得出你努力了很久才走到这一步，这份成就该属于你。我很高兴能稍微帮上点忙。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1165
translate chinese farm2_ae2fd155:

    # mc "Also… It wasn’t just me, [blo] did most of the work."
    mc "再说了…也不光是我的功劳，[blo]才是主力。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1167
translate chinese farm2_55238095:

    # hon "Hehehe! I appreciate it more than you know, sugarcube. It was a surprise to find someone out there willing to put themselves out there to support me like you did."
    hon "呵呵！这份心意比你想的更重要，甜心。能遇到像你这样主动挺身支持我的人，真是意外惊喜。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1169
translate chinese farm2_1324ba5e:

    # hon "That means a lot to me. Like, a lot…"
    hon "这对我来说意义重大。真的…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1170
translate chinese farm2_7b2c6976:

    # mc "It was my pleasure, [hon]."
    mc "这是我的荣幸，[hon]。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1172
translate chinese farm2_21122e3b:

    # hon "Your pleasure? Not yet it ain’t, [mc], but it will be later when I’m riding you till you see stars."
    hon "你的荣幸？还早哦[mc]，等会我骑到你眼冒金星的时候那才叫享受呢。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1176
translate chinese farm2_49006d40:

    # hon "Ahaha, a challenge? Is that how you see me? My, I didn’t think I could be complimented by something like that."
    hon "啊哈哈，这算挑战吗？原来你是这么看我的？啧啧，没想到这种事也能算夸奖呢。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1179
translate chinese farm2_da32aae0:

    # hon "Ahaha, fine. I’ll go easy on ya, stud… {i}Maybe{/i}…"
    hon "啊哈哈，行吧。我会对你温柔点的，伙计…{i} 也许… {/i}"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1182
translate chinese farm2_35e2be7b:

    # hon "And with all that help you’ve done around the farm too…"
    hon "再加上你在农场帮了这么多忙…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1184
translate chinese farm2_acda549c:

    # hon "Mamma always said that if you’ve got a good man beside, ya, y’all wrap those legs so tight he can’t pull out."
    hon "妈妈总说要是遇着好男人，就得用腿缠得他逃都逃不掉~"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1185
translate chinese farm2_3d248320:

    # mc "Your mother really said that? Well... I’m glad I could live up to your standards."
    mc "你妈真这么说过？好吧…挺高兴我能达到你的标准。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1187
translate chinese farm2_4327a848:

    # hon "Bwahaha, ya still need to prove yourself in the bedroom first, stud. How about… hmm…"
    hon "噗哈哈，想证明自己还得先过床上这关呢，伙计。要不…嗯…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1188
translate chinese farm2_45f210b5:

    # "While talking, she had been clearing the table. However, her gaze drifted to the bottle of milk left behind by Anna, now resting on the counter."
    "她说话时一直在收拾桌子，但目光却飘向Anna留下的那瓶牛奶——此刻正静静躺在台面上。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1189
translate chinese farm2_a22e0b44:

    # mc "How about what?"
    mc "比如说…？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1191
translate chinese farm2_c7ca0036:

    # "[hon]’s fingers danced over the bottle’s surface, her expression changing from thought to amusement."
    "[hon]的指尖在瓶身上轻轻敲击，表情从沉思渐渐转为玩味。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1192
translate chinese farm2_19e51b34:

    # hon "Ya know… This milk might be more than just a simple gift."
    hon "要知道…这牛奶可能不光是份普通礼物哦。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1193
translate chinese farm2_8020f682:

    # hon "It’s an aphrodisiac, but I’ve also heard that it can do more than just ignite a flame. It can, in some cases, change you..."
    hon "这确实是催情剂，但我还听说它不止能点火…有时候甚至能使人改变…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1194
translate chinese farm2_185ff8da:

    # mc "Changes? I’ve only heard about its aphrodisiacal properties. Are there long-term effects?"
    mc "改变？我只听说过它的催情效果。难道还有长期影响？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1196
translate chinese farm2_39976bb9:

    # hon "I’m talking enlarged breasts, heightened arousal… even a shift in personality."
    hon "比如胸部变大，性欲增强…甚至性格转变。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1197
translate chinese farm2_e9c19e84:

    # hon "Imagine being so overtaken by it that you revert… almost like… like the animals I breed out back."
    hon "想象一下被欲望彻底掌控，甚至退化成…几乎像是…像我后院饲养的那些动物一样。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1199
translate chinese farm2_8784854a:

    # "She tilted the bottle, watching the liquid slosh with a thoughtful frown. I remembered the intensity of the milk from the other world, with its power to raise a person’s arousal to near-unmanageable levels. But what she was saying is new to me."
    "她倾斜瓶子望着液体晃荡，若有所思地蹙起眉。我记得那个世界的牛奶有多烈——能把人的情欲撩拨到几乎失控的程度。但她刚说的这些我可是头回听说。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1201
translate chinese farm2_d8fad0d7:

    # hon "It’s funny, the animals here at the farm go into heat the same time of year as I do. Their behaviours are instinctual. They get mounted. They get penetrated. It’s all so raw, so driven by nature…"
    hon "说来有趣，农场里的动物每年都和我同一时期发情。它们的行为全凭本能。被骑乘、被插入，一切都那么原始，完全被天性驱使…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1202
translate chinese farm2_a7f578dc:

    # hon "I wonder how different we really are when we’re in heat too?"
    hon "你说我们发情的时候，到底又能和它们有多大差别呢？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1203
translate chinese farm2_5a92d04c:

    # hon "Maybe we're only ever a small push away from our primal nature...."
    hon "或许我们离显露原始本性…只差轻轻推一把。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1204
translate chinese farm2_b374ada2:

    # hon "What if this milk — this aphrodisiac — was that push?"
    hon "万一这牛奶——这催情剂——就是那股推力呢？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1205
translate chinese farm2_6439611e:

    # "Her face met mine with nothing but an earnest lip bite."
    "她抬头看向我，什么也没说，只是认真地咬了下嘴唇。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1206
translate chinese farm2_f94831e2:

    # mc "Sounds like you're into that."
    mc "听起来你好像挺喜欢这样呢。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1208
translate chinese farm2_b9eabd7a:

    # hon "That's right, stud. My favourite part about sex is how your mind goes numb and you're left with only burning need and desire."
    hon "没错，伙计。关于性，我最喜欢的部分，就是那种脑子一片空白，只剩下火烧火燎的渴求和欲望的感觉。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1210
translate chinese farm2_c1e5b864:

    # hon "Eh-hem… If I were to drink this, stud, would you be the one to… take care of me? To guide me through whatever happens next?"
    hon "呃哼…要是喝了这个，伙计，你会不会…照顾我？带着我应对接下来发生的任何状况？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1211
translate chinese farm2_f330145b:

    # mc "That’s quite a request… Especially since we haven't..."
    mc "这要求可真不一般…尤其咱俩还没…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1212
translate chinese farm2_f6e867b5:

    # hon "It's precisely because we haven't done anything yet. Why not make it explosive and memorable? You only ever get one first impression~"
    hon "正因为还什么都没发生过，才更应该让它爆裂般难忘呀。第一印象可只有一次呢~"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1213
translate chinese farm2_fcf223df:

    # "It wasn’t just a matter of physical indulgence; it was an invitation to explore deeper aspects of her desires."
    "这不止是身体上的放纵，更是她邀请对方共同探索内心深处欲望的仪式。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1217
translate chinese farm2_158b330d:

    # mc "It only seems appropriate as a celebration for today, right? Let’s see what happens."
    mc "就当是庆祝今天的成果，也挺合适的对吧？咱们看看会发生什么。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1219
translate chinese farm2_d9d6f043:

    # hon "Alright. Here goes nothing!"
    hon "好！那就试试看！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1220
translate chinese farm2_bc213da7:

    # "I watched as [hon] tipped the bottle to her lips, taking a slow sip. The creamy liquid slipped down her throat, and I saw a momentary shiver. Her eyes darted between the bottle and me as she pulled back, wiping her lips dry."
    "我看着[hon]把瓶子倾向唇边，慢慢抿了一口。乳白的液体滑过她的喉咙，我注意到她轻轻打了个颤。她撤回瓶子时，眼睛在我和奶瓶之间快速瞟了几下，然后擦干了嘴唇。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1222
translate chinese farm2_37321dc0:

    # hon "Hm… I feel no different, sugarcube. It just tastes like ordinary milk."
    hon "嗯…没什么特别感觉，甜心。喝起来就是普通牛奶嘛。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1224
translate chinese farm2_13e76c80:

    # hon "{i}Sigh{/i} How sobering! Now I feel silly for saying all that stuff about animal instincts and urges! Bwahaha."
    hon "{i} 唉 {/i}真下头！刚才说什么动物本能冲动的，现在觉得自己真够傻的！哈哈哈。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1225
translate chinese farm2_304747c4:

    # mc "I wouldn't be so sure! You've got to give it a few minutes first."
    mc "先别这么早下定论呀！总得等上几分钟才见效呢。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1227
translate chinese farm2_4a2debb2:

    # hon "I know, I know... I still feel silly though~"
    hon "知道啦知道啦…可我还是觉得好傻呀~"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1229
translate chinese farm2_263a0b00:

    # hon "Say, we haven't actually had a chance to catch up since you got here. How've you been?"
    hon "对了，你来了之后咱们还没好好聊过呢。最近怎么样？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1231
translate chinese farm2_0332afc5:

    # "We started talking to pass the time, about anything and everything. Minutes passed. The changes were subtle at first — her shoulders relaxed; her posture softened."
    "我们开始东拉西扯地闲聊打发时间。几分钟过去，变化起初很细微——她的肩膀放松下来，身姿也变得柔软。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1232
translate chinese farm2_22b417ec:

    # "Her usual demeanor began to smooth out, replaced by something else entirely. Her tail began unconsciously flicking back and forth... kind of like a horse in heat."
    "她惯常的拘谨开始消融，逐渐被另一种状态取代。尾巴无意识地来回轻摆…有点像发情期的雌驹。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1233
translate chinese farm2_ca020135:

    # "Her speech stumbled, her pattern of thought became more and more simplistic."
    "她说话开始磕巴，思维模式也越来越简单直白。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1234
translate chinese farm2_65fe554a:

    # "Then, there was a gradual change in her voice. It began to sound higher, softer. She started laughing at things that barely even registered as jokes."
    "接着，她的嗓音渐渐起了变化。声调变高了，也更轻柔了。她开始对着根本不好笑的话题发笑。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1235
translate chinese farm2_6b1b42c8:

    # "And while I wouldn’t call [hon] a tomboy, she had gradually become more girlish and touchier."
    "虽然我不会说[hon]是个假小子，但她确实变得越来越少女，也更敏感了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1236
translate chinese farm2_08cd538b:

    # "Only few more minutes later and the affection was pouring out of her every word and movement. She was always a confident mare, but even she had certain inhibitions that seemed to just melt away."
    "才过了几分钟，她的一言一行都充满了爱意。她向来是匹自信的雌驹，但就连她那些拘束也好像突然融化了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1238
translate chinese farm2_bcce4e39:

    # hon "Oh… Is it working? I can’t tell."
    hon "哦…起效了吗？我都分不清了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1239
translate chinese farm2_d18d0c72:

    # "She asked in a soft voice, as if only just realizing that she was changing, but despite this shock, she couldn’t muster the usual energy to care."
    "她用软绵绵的声音问道，好像刚意识到自己在变化，但尽管惊讶，却提不起往常的劲头去在意。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1240
translate chinese farm2_8a6a2bba:

    # mc "It’s changing you quite a lot… I haven’t seen it do anything like this before."
    mc "这玩意儿把你变得真够明显的…我以前从没见过这种效果。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1241
translate chinese farm2_6b405db7:

    # "My eyes move from the bottle of milk, then over to the empty bottle of cider beside it."
    "我的视线从牛奶上移开，转到旁边空了的苹果酒瓶子上。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1242
translate chinese farm2_c480cece:

    # mc "Could it be… Mixing alcohol and milk does this?"
    mc "难道是因为…酒精混着牛奶喝才这样？"

