    hon "这么着，下次我给你策划个绝妙点子，让你想拒绝都难。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1444
translate chinese hon2_5bf81d51:

    # mc "Now you’re thinking big! I can’t wait to see what you have in store for me next."
    mc "这才叫有魄力！我已经等不及要看你下次给我准备什么惊喜了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1447
translate chinese hon2_f1e9b688:

