    "几分钟后…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1457
translate chinese hon2_802054bc:

    # hon "Yup! Should be able to do the entire field by myself. I bet it'll be a lot less tiring too."
    hon "没错！整片地我自己应该就能搞定。估计还能省力不少呢。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1459
translate chinese hon2_5d711871:

