    blo "真的？天哪，这真是太好了！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1461
translate chinese hon2_c2bc4f0e:

    # hon "I heard you were the one that sent the letter. I'm really proud of y'all for going behind my back to set that up. It's the kind of thing I would have done."
    hon "听说那封信是你们瞒着我偷偷安排的？干得漂亮——这种事儿我自己也会做。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1463
translate chinese hon2_70cdc0c5:

    # blo "I am trying to be a little more brave lately. It's uh, a little hard though! But I need to take control of my own life, right, [mc]?"
    blo "最近我在试着勇敢一点。呃，虽然还挺难的！但我得把自己的生活掌握在手里，对吧，[mc]？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1464
