    blo "还没想好要做什么呢。或许下次你来的时候，我就能有些主意了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1468
translate chinese hon2_6d203871:

    # hon "No rush, sugar. The news only just broke! Go put your feet up and rest while you figure things out."
    hon "不着急，甜心。消息才刚传开呢！你先放松休息，慢慢考虑。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1470
translate chinese hon2_ad29c27e:

