    "趁时间还不算太晚，我回到了公寓…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1477
translate chinese hon2_6f73698a:

    # "Once inside, [mox] bounced up from the sofa and greeted me a cuddle and a smooch on the lips."
    "一进门，[mox]就从沙发上蹦起来迎接我，又是搂抱又是亲嘴的。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1479
translate chinese hon2_a05af8ed:

    # mox "Mmmm... Your skin feels so good against my fur. Any mare is lucky to have you~"
    mox "嗯…你的皮肤蹭着我的毛皮真舒服。哪个女孩能拥有你都是福气~"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1480
translate chinese hon2_ced9b6c1:

    # mc "It does seem like the perfect combo. Am I the only furless anthropomorph in Arcadia?"
    mc "这搭配确实绝了。我难道是Arcadia唯一不长毛的类人生物吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1482
translate chinese hon2_e20c914b:

