    mox "说不准。龙族倒是也有，但鳞片总归没皮肤这么软乎。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1483
translate chinese hon2_98488cb7:

    # mc "Let's say you could choose to be any other creature you want, what would you pick?"
    mc "假设你可以选择成为任何你想要的生物，你会选什么？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1485
translate chinese hon2_9a6331f7:

    # mox "A tough question… I mean, there are just so many! Dragons with their flight and fire breath… Cats with their night vision and reflexes…"
    mox "这题可真难答…选择也太多了！龙能飞会喷火…猫科动物夜视厉害反应又快…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1486
translate chinese hon2_01a16945:

    # mox "But the real issue for me is, how am I supposed to top magic? I think being a unicorn is as good as it gets."
    mox "可对我来说最关键的是——还有什么能比魔法更厉害？我觉得当独角兽已经够完美了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1487
translate chinese hon2_5f8c3014:

    # mc "That’s a good point. Are there are other species in this world that are known for their magic?"
    mc "说得在理。这世界上还有没有其他以魔法闻名的种族？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1489
translate chinese hon2_e4c3303f:

    # mox "There're plenty of cases of species having weaker magical capabilities even without a horn. In this country we have sirens, hippogriffs, sea ponies and morphlings."
    mox "确实有不少种族就算没角也具备魔法能力，只是弱一些。光这个国家就有海妖、鹰马、海马和幻形灵。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1490
translate chinese hon2_f800e310:

    # mox "In other countries, I’ve heard about kitsune, thunderbirds, basilisks, sphinx and others. Usually all with their own specialized set of magical abilities."
    mox "其他国家我还听说过妖狐、雷鸟、蛇怪、狮身人面像什么的。通常都各有各的专属魔法能力。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1491
translate chinese hon2_0586f04c:

    # mox "A surprising amount are specialized in disguises and the magic of trickery. I wonder if that’s an evolutionary adaption due to lower male birth rates?"
    mox "没想到这么多种族都专精伪装和诡计魔法。该不会是因为雄性出生率低演化出来的适应能力吧？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1492
translate chinese hon2_c3793b00:

    # mox "Maybe I’d be a phoenix, pseudo-immortality sounds nice! What about you?"
    mox "说不定我会选凤凰，伪永生听着挺不错！你呢？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1493
translate chinese hon2_0d9a885d:

