    mc "啊哈哈，这么说来…我大概会想当个…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1502
translate chinese hon2_a31d58fd:

    # mox "Have you heard how tall those guys can get?! And the stories… I wonder if I could even handle minotaur [mc]."
    mox "你听说过他们能长多高吗？！还有那些传闻…我都怀疑自己能不能驾驭得了牛头怪[mc]。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1505
translate chinese hon2_d4fe40e5:

    # mox "That’d make you even hotter~! I wonder they really do have two penises, or if that was just a rumor?"
    mox "那你会更带劲哦~！不过他们真有两个肉棒吗？还是说只是谣言？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1508
translate chinese hon2_8771c744:

    # mox "Ooohh, wolf [mc] sounds sexy! You’ll have to growl while you nibble my ear."
    mox "喔呜，狼版[mc]听着真带感！啃耳朵的时候可得配上低吼哦。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1511
translate chinese hon2_aaff47e5:

    # mox "I like you just how you are now, but you’d hear no complaints from me, stud!"
    mox "我就喜欢你现在这样，不过真要变了我肯定也没意见，伙计！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1514
translate chinese hon2_248bf38c:

    # mox "Meeeow! Now there’s a {i}big{/i} cat~! Can I join your pride?"
    mox "喵呜~这可是只{i} 大号 {/i}猫猫呢！能收我进你的狮群吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1517
translate chinese hon2_a4448219:

    # mox "I don’t know much about foxes, but I do know they have a reputation for being quite mischievous!"
    mox "我对狐狸了解不多，但听说它们可是出了名的爱搞恶作剧！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1520
translate chinese hon2_c6c7927f:

    # mox "Yeah! In a world as expansive as this, why limit your options?"
    mox "就是！世界这么大，干嘛限制自己的选择呢？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1522
translate chinese hon2_43234412:

    # mox "Uhm, could you remind me what a human is?"
    mox "那...你能告诉我人类是什么吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1523
translate chinese hon2_b97066f2:

    # mc "In my world, it’s a type of primate that evolved to be the sole anthropomorphic creature on my planet. Evolution for every other species didn’t progress in the same way, or the same speed."
    mc "在我那边，我们人类算一种灵长类动物，只不过最后进化成了我这样子。我们星球其他生物不是这样进化的。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1525
translate chinese hon2_a18ce2e7:

    # mox "Wow, so you’re the most special in your world, but the least special in this one?"
    mox "哇哦，你是说你在你那边就是个无名小卒，但是到这边就成了最特别的？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1526
translate chinese hon2_66c4e50d:

    # mc "I guess you could say that. I imagine that even the anthro monkies in this world are going to be far stronger and more agile than me while keeping up in intelligence."
    mc "有一说一确实，我想就算是这里的“猿人”也会比我敏捷强壮，同时还有智慧。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1528
translate chinese hon2_a0534fe1:

    # mox "I never heard of a monkey until we first met, but I checked and to my surprise, on the other side of the planet, there’s a small country full of them."
    mox "我们认识之前我还真不知道有猴子这种生物。但后来我查到地球另一端真有一个小国全是猴子，真令我吃惊。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1529
translate chinese hon2_1822955a:

    # mc "Wow, I wonder how differently my life might have gone if I ended up in a city full of dog girls instead of mares."
    mc "哇，如果我去了一个全是狗娘而不是雌驹的城市，我的故事会不会是天差地别。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1531
translate chinese hon2_0bba9998:

