    mox "哈哈，狗娘受雄驹喜欢是有原因的。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1532
translate chinese hon2_dd17acec:

    # mc "It’s crazy that this world is so expansive that there are entire species of people you’re not aware of."
    mc "世界真大，居然还有你不知道的物种。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1534
translate chinese hon2_2e8f5a9c:

    # mox "I suppose in your world, everyone is human, but an equivalent would be you not knowing every single animal on your planet."
    mox "我想在你那边，大家都是人，但是你们也不可能认全你们那边每一个动物吧。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1535
translate chinese hon2_ad759c05:

    # mc "You’ve got me there, there must be over a million species of animals, and those are only the ones we’ve discovered."
    mc "你说对了，世界上有超过100万种动物，而这些还只是我们发现的。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1537
translate chinese hon2_ecbda966:

    # mox "Haha, then there’s our crazy universe where any one of those animals can be walking and talking. But as if that’s not enough, some of us can cast {i}magic{/i}!"
    mox "哈哈，但在我们这边，那些动物都会走路说话。更牛逼的是，有些甚至还会{i}魔法{/i}！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1538
translate chinese hon2_dbdc358e:

    # mc "When you put it like that, it’s a wonder I haven’t gone crazy yet."
    mc "你这么说，我还没疯也很牛逼了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1540
translate chinese hon2_bcd6f60d:

    # "[mox] and I chat for a few more minutes before we decided to call it a night."
    "我和[mox]又聊了几分钟，然后我们决定今晚就到此为止。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1551
translate chinese farm3_328b4ba8:

