    # "Her face lights up with genuine excitement, and before we know it, we’re already on the way."
    "她脸上立刻绽放出真切的笑容，还没等我们反应过来，就已经动身出发了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1982
translate chinese farm4_454ced4e:

    # "And I know just the perfect place to take her…"
    "而且我知道有个特别适合带她去的地方…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1985
translate chinese farm4_6ed9e9f0:

    # "The city hums with life as we arrive at [rub]’s brothel, its neon sign buzzing overhead, casting red and purple hues onto the pavement."
    "当我们来到[rub]经营的会所时，整座城市正沉浸在喧嚣的夜生活中。霓虹灯牌在头顶嗡嗡闪烁，将红色与紫色的光影投洒在人行道上。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1987
translate chinese farm4_58e086b2:

    # mc "You ready? Stepping inside for the first time can be the most overwhelming part."
    mc "准备好了吗？第一次走进这种地方可能会有点紧张哦。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1988
translate chinese farm4_29c9d29f:

    # blo "Heh… No… But let’s do it anyway."
    blo "呵呵…还没…但不管怎样，我们进去吧。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1989
translate chinese farm4_e64e7808:

    # mc "That’s the spirit."
    mc "这样才对嘛！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1991
translate chinese farm4_c90d900f:

    # "Inside, the brothel was alive like a club, but had the benefit of fewer patrons and smaller crowds. Perfect for [blo]'s first time."
    "妓院内部像夜店般热闹，但客人不多，氛围也更轻松，对[blo]的初次体验来说正合适。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1992
translate chinese farm4_c0e508e6:

    # "The lights pulse in sync with the thumping bass, and a bunch of people dance and laugh like they’ve got nothing to lose."
    "灯光随着低音节奏明灭闪烁，人们纵情舞动欢笑，仿佛抛开了一切顾虑。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1993
translate chinese farm4_1a1f34ac:

    # "[blo] sticks close as we weave through. She’s wide-eyed, taking it all in like a tourist in a foreign land."
    "[blo]紧跟着我穿行其间。她睁大眼睛，像个初到异国的游客般好奇地打量一切。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1995
translate chinese farm4_c55131c0:

    # misc "Over here!"
    misc "这边！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:1996
translate chinese farm4_571f15e7:

    # "A voice calls out, cutting through the music. Bingo."
    "一道声音穿透音乐传来。找到了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2002
translate chinese farm4_c11465f5:

    # "[mel] saunters over, drink in hand, signature smug grin firmly in place, and theme music inexplicably playing."
    "[mel]悠闲地晃了过来，手里端着酒杯，脸上挂着那副标志性的得意笑容，背景里还莫名响起了她的专属主题曲。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2003
translate chinese farm4_d7bbe51e:

    # mel "Well, well… Didn’t expect to see {i}you{/i} here, [blo]. And with him, no less."
    mel "哎呀呀…真没想到会在这儿见到{i} 你 {/i}啊，[blo]。居然还和他一起来了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2005
translate chinese farm4_0ebe7949:

    # "[blo] blushes, but [mel]’s teasing smile melts away her nerves."
    "[blo]脸红了，但[mel]戏谑的笑容反而让她放松了下来。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2006
translate chinese farm4_a6870424:

    # mc "You two met at the party in the castle, right?"
    mc "你们俩是在城堡那次派对上认识的吧？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2008
translate chinese farm4_92096b0c:

    # mel "Heh, yeah! But we go back way further than that, at least twelve years?"
    mel "呵呵，对呀！不过我们认识可早多了，少说也有十二年了吧？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2010
translate chinese farm4_d8ec6780:

    # blo "[mel] and I were friends back in elementary school, before she moved away."
    blo "[mel]和我小学时就认识了，只是后来她搬走了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2012
translate chinese farm4_8e353794:

    # mel "This your first time here?"
    mel "你是第一次来这儿吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2014
translate chinese farm4_c6ac07eb:

    # blo "It’s my first time at {i}any{/i} club…"
    blo "这是我第一次来{i} 这种 {/i}场所…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2016
translate chinese farm4_8b851204:

    # mel "Ohoho, we’re gonna have {i}fun{/i}! Stick with me, sweetie – I’ll show you the ropes."
    mel "哦嚯，我们可得好好{i} 玩个尽兴 {/i}！跟着我准没错，亲爱的——我来带你熟悉熟悉。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2018
translate chinese farm4_ab1bf2f6:

    # "We head to a bar and drinks are ordered while three of us continue to chat at the bar."
    "我们走进酒吧点了酒，三人继续靠在吧台旁聊天。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2024
translate chinese farm4_a3d87255:

    # "I watch as [mel] effortlessly pulls [blo] into a conversation. It feels like something between these two just clicks."
    "我看着[mel]游刃有余地将[blo]带入对话。她们之间仿佛有种天然的默契。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2025
translate chinese farm4_a3ff8cb6:

    # "[blo] immediately loosens up, her laughter coming easier with each exchange. [mel]’s confidence seems to rub off on her, and before long, they’re chatting as old friends."
    "[blo]很快放松下来，每次交谈都笑得更自在。[mel]的自信似乎感染了她，没多久两人就像老朋友般畅谈起来。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2026
translate chinese farm4_23657321:

    # "And that’s when it hits me: this is exactly what [blo] needed. Someone who could meet her where she is and pull her further. Someone like [mel]."
    "就在这时我忽然意识到：[blo]真正需要的正是这个。一个能理解她的处境并引领她向前的人。一个像[mel]这样的人。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2028
translate chinese farm4_c9ae2d03:

    # mel "… I don’t particularly like it either, but at least try!"
    mel "…虽然我也不太喜欢，但至少试试看嘛！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2030
translate chinese farm4_80419696:

    # blo "U-Uhm… Alright!"
    blo "呃…嗯…好吧！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2034
translate chinese farm4_65ea8928:

    # "Before I know it, [mel] is dragging [blo] onto the dance floor. I lean against the bar and watch as they both sway to the music, [blo]’s face glowing like she’s been doing this her whole life."
    "还没等我反应过来，[mel]已经拉着[blo]滑进舞池。我靠着吧台看她们随音乐摇曳，[blo]容光焕发的模样仿佛天生就擅长此事。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2035
translate chinese farm4_9e825914:

    # "Some things are just meant to be, no matter the odds. No matter the universe."
    "有些缘分注定会发生，无论概率多渺茫，无论在哪个宇宙。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2036
translate chinese farm4_bd243168:

    # "After a while, the girls make their way back to me, both flushed and breathless."
    "过了一会儿，姑娘们回到我身边，两人都脸颊泛红、呼吸急促。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2042
translate chinese farm4_4178f645:

    # mel "So, Mr. Chaperone, what’s been keeping you busy? Still out here trying to save the world one pep talk at a time?"
    mel "所以，护花使者先生，刚才在忙什么呀？依然在这儿靠灌鸡汤拯救世界吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2043
translate chinese farm4_66cd1a97:

    # mc "Someone had to do it, otherwise I wouldn't be able to hang out here."
    mc "总得有人当护花使者嘛，不然我哪能在这儿逍遥。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2045
translate chinese farm4_d7479411:

    # mel "Seriously though... thank you. For taking care of the darkness. I’ve felt this real... sense of relief since then. For the first time, I can focus on the future without all the doubts and worries weighing me down."
    mel "说真的…谢谢你。替我驱散了那些阴霾。从那之后我一直感到…如释重负。这是头一回我能真正专注未来，不再被疑虑和担忧拖累。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2047
translate chinese farm4_dcf4e1db:

    # mel "Tsk, look at me. Sounding like a rescued damsel."
    mel "啧，瞧我这样。说得像个被拯救的落难少女似的。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2048
translate chinese farm4_b9dce10f:

    # mc "I wouldn’t exactly call you a damsel…"
    mc "我倒不觉得你像落难少女…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2050
translate chinese farm4_6cb07ef7:

    # mel "Hmph… Well, your girl’s full of surprises~ You really took to the dancing, [blo]."
    mel "哼…不过你的小女友可是充满惊喜呢~你跳得真投入啊，[blo]。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2052
translate chinese farm4_abc76d83:

    # blo "{i}Pant, pant{/i} I never thought I’d enjoy that. Thanks for, uh, forcing me?"
    blo "{i} 哈啊，哈啊 {/i}没想到我会喜欢跳舞。谢谢你，呃，逼我试试？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2054
translate chinese farm4_f3c8a25e:

    # mel "Don’t mention it! I’ll happily force you outside your comfort zone again, if you’re up for it~"
    mel "别客气！只要你愿意，我随时乐意再推你跨出舒适圈哦~"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2056
translate chinese farm4_51762262:

    # blo "Uhm, s-sure?"
    blo "呃，好-好啊。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2057
translate chinese farm4_2e760cbd:

    # mc "Poor [blo] has no idea what she just signed up for."
    mc "可怜的[blo]完全不知道自己答应了什么。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2059
translate chinese farm4_41796f74:

    # mel "Tsk, just ignore this nerd. He’ll get what’s coming to him later. Now, I have so many questions for you I didn’t have a chance to ask you at the castle. What’s the deal with you these days?"
    mel "啧，别理这个书呆子。晚点再收拾他。现在我可有一堆城堡里没来得及问的问题——你最近到底在忙什么呀？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2061
translate chinese farm4_1e05588a:

    # blo "Ahaha… it’s not that exciting. I’ve been helping out on the farm — keeping things running while my sister takes care of the bigger stuff. It’s hard work, but I like it."
    blo "啊哈哈…其实没什么特别的。我一直在农场帮忙——姐姐处理重要事务时，我就负责维持日常运转。虽然辛苦，但我很喜欢。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2062
translate chinese farm4_35e938a4:

    # blo "It’s just temporary, until I figure out what I really want to do."
    blo "这只是暂时的，等我想清楚真正想做什么之后再说。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2064
translate chinese farm4_2fb1a072:

    # mel "Farm life, huh? Bet that keeps you grounded. Meanwhile, I’m over here drowning in spreadsheets and trying not to punch annoying patrons in the face. Glamorous, right?"
    mel "农场生活？听起来很踏实呢。不像我整天对着表格忙到头晕，还得忍着不对讨厌的客人挥拳头。光鲜吧？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2065
translate chinese farm4_b2b45260:

    # mc "Still, you’re both thriving. Full of potential."
    mc "但你们都过得很好啊。充满潜力。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2067
translate chinese farm4_8d37fbec:

    # mel "Thriving is a bit generous. But hey, I can’t complain too much after what I went through, I’m not exactly complaining."
    mel "“过得很好”可能有点夸张啦。不过经历了那些事后，我也没什么可抱怨的，真的。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2068
translate chinese farm4_512eafa1:

    # "For a moment, the neon lights played off [mel]’s sleek augmentations, emphasizing the stark difference between it and her natural skin."
    "某一瞬间，霓虹灯光掠过[mel]光滑的义体，与她天然的肌肤形成鲜明对比。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2070
translate chinese farm4_bd9322da:

    # blo "[mel]… I’d been meaning to ask… your face, and arm…"
    blo "[mel]…我一直想问问…你的脸和手臂…"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2072
translate chinese farm4_d736553a:

    # mel "Eh? Oh. I had a brief encounter with the darkness. Ancient history now. But yes, it left its mark."
    mel "嗯？哦。我与黑暗有过短暂的接触。都是老黄历啦。不过确实留下了痕迹。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2073
translate chinese farm4_6295dcd3:

    # mel "Lost my home. Nearly lost myself. These enhancements were the only way to keep going."
    mel "失去了家。差点也丢了自己。这些改造是让我继续前进的唯一办法。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2075
translate chinese farm4_d02337f8:

    # blo "I’m sorry to hear that. It must’ve been... terrifying."
    blo "听到这些我很难过。那一定……很可怕。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2077
translate chinese farm4_d0db2384:

    # mel "But they’re also a constant reminder that I made it through. I survived."
    mel "但它们也时刻提醒着我：我挺过来了。我活下来了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2078
translate chinese farm4_29cb55c5:

    # "She flexed her augmented hand, purposely catching the neon glow again. There wasn’t a trace of bitterness in her tone."
    "她活动了一下改造过的手，故意让霓虹灯光再次掠过表面。她的语气里没有一丝苦涩。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2080
translate chinese farm4_98dc8af9:

    # blo "That takes real strength, [mel]."
    blo "这需要真正的勇气，[mel]。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2082
translate chinese farm4_1d8e9f83:

    # mel "Heh, look at yourself, [blo]. When we were kids, I had to practically drag you outside to play. Now you’re at a club and keeping this guy in check."
    mel "呵，看看你自己，[blo]。小时候我还得硬拽你出门玩，现在都能在俱乐部镇住这家伙了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2083
translate chinese farm4_ace07a6e:

    # mc "She’s not wrong. You’re doing things now that probably seemed impossible a year ago."
    mc "她说得没错。你正在做的事，一年前恐怕还觉得根本做不到吧。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2085
translate chinese farm4_a012efa8:

    # blo "I don’t know if that’s a fair comparison… but this is definitely different for me. The farm’s been my world for too long, you know?"
    blo "我不知道这算不算公平的比较…但对我来说确实很不一样。你知道的，农场曾经是我的全世界。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2087
translate chinese farm4_5e21d664:

    # mel "Different is good. Trust me, that’s how you grow."
    mel "不一样是好事。相信我，这就是你的成长方式。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2088
translate chinese farm4_8792cdca:

    # mc "Alright, enough with the heavy stuff. We’re at a club, not a therapy session!"
    mc "好啦，沉重话题到此为止。我们可是在俱乐部，又不是开心理辅导会！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2090
translate chinese farm4_a7ceec4b:

    # mel "That’s rich coming from my personal therapist."
    mel "这话从我的专属心理顾问嘴里说出来可真新鲜。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2092
translate chinese farm4_816648f6:

    # blo "Why don’t you come dance with us, [mc]?"
    blo "不如一起来跳舞吧，[mc]？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2093
translate chinese farm4_aac6db16:

    # mc "Me? I mean, I, uh…"
    mc "我？我是说，我呃……"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2095
translate chinese farm4_abd0556a:

    # mel "What’s the matter? Afraid that we'll show you up? For once, this is something I won't bully you about~"
    mel "怎么啦？怕被我们比下去吗？这次我可不会笑话你哦～"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2096
translate chinese farm4_3d3424c0:

    # "This time [blo] was dragging me in! When did I become the shy one?"
    "这次居然是[blo]拽着我进去！我什么时候变成害羞的那个了？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2098
translate chinese farm4_0a7f8df5:

    # "I let myself get pulled in. The music swallowed us as we stepped onto the dance floor, the bass pumping through my chest."
    "我任由自己被拉进去。踏上舞池的瞬间音乐便将我们吞没，低音节奏震得胸腔发颤。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2099
translate chinese farm4_a9eafdad:

    # mc "I’m wondering how I got roped into this so quickly."
    mc "我还在想怎么这么快就被卷进来了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2102
translate chinese farm4_4cc21a02:

    # blo "I’m holding you to your own advice! This is why we came, right?"
    blo "我这是在践行你自己的建议！我们不就是为此而来的吗？"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2104
translate chinese farm4_3ae82ed7:

    # "The three of us danced for a solid twenty minutes, caught up in the rhythm and the crowd, until the beat began to slow and fatigue settled in."
    "我们三人随着人群与节奏尽情舞动了整整二十分钟，直到旋律渐缓，倦意袭来。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2110
translate chinese farm4_76d9fb5f:

    # mel "Alright, you two. I think we’ve earned ourselves a break. Let’s find somewhere quieter to… unwind."
    mel "好了二位。咱们该休息一下了。找个安静的地方…放松会儿。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2111
translate chinese farm4_591ec1c1:

    # blo "Quieter sounds nice."
    blo "安静点的地方挺好。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2113
translate chinese farm4_c64caf9b:

    # mel "Trust me, you’re gonna love this."
    mel "相信我，你们会喜欢的。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2116
translate chinese farm4_fb666ba2:

    # "I raised an eyebrow at [mel]’s suggestion, and she replied with a grin, clearly enjoying her role as the instigator. With a casual wave, she led the way."
    "我对[mel]的提议挑了挑眉，她回了个咧嘴笑，显然很享受自己带头闹腾的角色。她随意地挥挥手就往前走了。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2119
translate chinese farm4_933c5111:

    # "We found a private booth tucked away from the crowded main floor, the music still thumping faintly through the walls, but muffled enough to give us a break."
    "我们在远离主厅人群的角落找到半封闭的卡座，音乐隔着墙传来低沉的节拍，既保留氛围又不至于太过嘈杂。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2120
translate chinese farm4_f92b5d7e:

    # "[blo] slid onto the plush seat first, almost glowing with newfound energy. [mel] followed, settling next to her with her usual cool confidence."
    "[blo]率先陷进软座里，整个人焕发着前所未有的活力。[mel]跟着坐下，带着一贯的从容靠在她身边。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2123
translate chinese farm4_805669fa:

    # blo "This is cozy!"
    blo "这里很舒服！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2126
translate chinese farm4_6705e9db:

    # mel "Exactly. Cozy is the idea~"
    mel "没错~要的就是这种放松的感觉呢。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2127
translate chinese farm4_a517fe04:

    # "[mel] shoots me a knowing glance as I settled into the seat across from them."
    "我在她们对面的座位坐下时，[mel]朝我递来一个心照不宣的眼神。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2129
translate chinese farm4_0a92e9c9:

    # blo "I didn’t realize how overwhelming it could be out there. It’s exciting, but… this feels better. I can actually hear you two talk!"
    blo "我之前没想到外面会这么让人紧张。虽然很刺激，但……这样更舒服。现在总算能听清你们说话啦！"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2130
translate chinese farm4_de768637:

    # "[mel] chuckles softly, brushing a strand of [blo]’s hair behind her ear."
    "[mel]轻轻笑了笑，顺手将[blo]耳边的一缕碎发捋到后面。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2132
translate chinese farm4_4e9f3e07:

    # mel "That’s the magic of nights like these. Step out of your ordinary life, and... who knows? You might surprise yourself."
    mel "这就是夜晚的魅力呀。跳出日常生活的框框，然后……谁知道呢？说不定会发现自己新的一面哦。"

# game/4.3 - Farm Route.rpy:2134
